                  {
                    "value": "• Adzuna truncates job descriptions, so skill counts are low (235 mentions in total).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Company names are not cleaned: some Adzuna employers include extra text, e.g. \"SimVentions, Inc - Glassdoor ✪ 4.6\".",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• \"(Blank)\" in the states chart means jobs with no state in the source data.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• One Adzuna salary (HelloTech, 40–57) is an hourly rate; it is filtered out of salary charts.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• All jobs share one load date (2026-09-08); posting dates are not in the data yet.",
